(136, 5, NULL, 'Luxe Marquise Cluster Adjustable Ring – 925 Sterling Silver', 'luxe-marquise-cluster-adjustable-ring-925-sterling-silver', 'RNSL023', 'Silver', '925', 4.290, 'Free Size (Adjustable)', 2790.00, 6499.00, 40.00, 3.00, '7113', 3, 0, 'Luxe Marquise Cluster Adjustable Ring | Pearlica', 'Shop luxe marquise cluster adjustable ring in 925 sterling silver with CZ stones. Bold, glamorous jewellery perfect for occasions and styling.', 'marquise cluster ring, adjustable ring, sterling silver ring, CZ ring, statement ring, luxury jewellery, festive jewellery, party wear ring, elegant ring, bold jewellery, Pearlica jewellery', 'Bold and luxurious, this 925 sterling silver adjustable ring showcases a stunning marquise-cut cubic zirconia cluster design. The elongated leaf-like stones are beautifully arranged in a layered formation, creating a rich and glamorous statement look.\r\nWith its intricate detailing and premium finish, this ring is perfect for weddings, festive occasions, and evening events where you want to stand out effortlessly.', '•	Metal: 925 Sterling Silver\r\n•	Finishing: High Polish Silver\r\n•	Stone Type: Cubic Zirconia\r\n•	Stone Cut: Marquise & Round Cut\r\n•	Design: Cluster Leaf Motif\r\n•	Style: Statement Adjustable Ring\r\n•	Closure: Adjustable Open Band', '•	92.5% Pure Sterling Silver\r\n•	Precision Laser Cut Craftsmanship\r\n•	AAA Grade Cubic Zirconia (where applicable)\r\n•	High-Durability Rhodium Plating\r\n•	Anti-Tarnish Protective Coating\r\n•	Mirror Gloss Premium Finish\r\n•	Lightweight & Comfortable for Daily Wear', '•	Perfect for bridal and festive styling\r\n•	Pair with statement silver earrings for a complete look\r\n•	Ideal for evening gowns and traditional attire\r\n•	Wear solo to let the bold cluster design shine', 'draft', '2026-03-20 07:13:14', '2026-07-25 21:17:53', NULL),
