(138, 5, NULL, 'Minimal Butterfly Grace Adjustable Ring – 925 Sterling Silver', 'minimal-butterfly-grace-adjustable-ring-925-sterling-silver', 'RNSL025', 'Silver', '925', 1.400, 'Free Size (Adjustable)', 0.00, 2165.00, 40.00, 3.00, '7113', 5, 0, 'Minimal Butterfly Adjustable Ring | Pearlica', 'Shop minimal butterfly adjustable ring in 925 sterling silver. Elegant, feminine jewellery perfect for daily wear and styling.', 'butterfly ring, adjustable ring, sterling silver ring, minimal jewellery, feminine jewellery, elegant ring, daily wear ring, delicate jewellery, stylish ring, symbolic jewellery, Pearlica jewellery', 'Delicate and charming, this 925 sterling silver adjustable ring features a beautifully crafted dual butterfly motif with fine textured detailing on the wings. The minimal design gives it a soft, graceful appeal — perfect for everyday elegance.\r\nLightweight and feminine, this ring symbolizes transformation and beauty, making it a lovely addition to any jewellery collection.', '•	Metal: 925 Sterling Silver\r\n•	Finishing: High Polish Silver\r\n•	Design: Dual Butterfly Motif\r\n•	Style: Minimal Adjustable Ring\r\n•	Surface Detail: Textured Wing Engraving\r\n•	Closure: Adjustable Open Band', '•	92.5% Pure Sterling Silver\r\n•	Precision Laser Cut Craftsmanship\r\n•	High-Durability Rhodium Plating\r\n•	Anti-Tarnish Protective Coating\r\n•	Mirror Gloss Premium Finish\r\n•	Lightweight & Comfortable for Daily Wear', '•	Perfect for daily wear and minimal styling\r\n•	Pair with butterfly studs for a cute coordinated look\r\n•	Ideal for casual outfits, college wear, or gifting\r\n•	Looks beautiful when stacked with thin silver bands', 'active', '2026-03-20 07:20:30', '2026-07-28 17:09:51', NULL),
(139, 5, NULL, 'Regal Baguette Crown Adjustable Ring – 925 Sterling Silver', 'regal-baguette-crown-adjustable-ring-925-sterling-silver', 'RNSL026', 'Silver', '925', 5.570, 'Free Size (Adjustable)', 3620.00, 8399.00, 40.00, 3.00, '7113', 5, 0, 'Regal Baguette Crown Adjustable Ring | Pearlica', 'Shop regal baguette crown adjustable ring in 925 sterling silver with CZ stones. Bold, luxurious jewellery perfect for statement styling.', 'crown ring, baguette ring, adjustable ring, sterling silver ring, CZ ring, statement ring, luxury jewellery, bold jewellery, elegant ring, stylish jewellery, Pearlica jewellery', 'A bold statement of royalty and brilliance, this 925 sterling silver adjustable ring features a striking crown-inspired design with a prominent center stone framed by precision-set baguette and micro CZ stones.\r\nThe structured band with layered detailing gives it a luxurious, high-end finish — perfect for those who love powerful, standout jewellery pieces. Designed to shine from every angle, this ring adds instant sophistication to any look.', '•	Metal: 925 Sterling Silver\r\n•	Plating: Premium Rhodium Finish\r\n•	Stone Type: High-Grade Cubic Zirconia\r\n•	Stone Cut: Baguette & Round Cut\r\n•	Design: Crown Inspired Statement Ring\r\n•	Setting Style: Multi-Row Channel & Micro Pave Setting\r\n•	Size: Free Size (Adjustable)', '•	92.5% Pure Sterling Silver\r\n•	Precision Stone Setting Technology\r\n•	Anti-Tarnish Rhodium Protection\r\n•	Skin-Friendly & Hypoallergenic\r\n•	Long-Lasting High Polish Shine\r\n•	Lightweight Yet Premium Feel', '•	Perfect for festive wear or wedding functions\r\n•	Pair with a silver tennis bracelet for a luxe look\r\n•	Ideal for cocktail parties and evening outfits\r\n•	Wear solo to make a bold statement', 'draft', '2026-03-20 07:23:07', '2026-07-25 19:36:14', NULL),
(140, 5, NULL, 'Celestial Spark Star Adjustable Ring – 925 Sterling Silver', 'celestial-spark-star-adjustable-ring-925-sterling-silver', 'RNSL027', 'Silver', '925', 1.600, 'Free Size (Adjustable)', 0.00, 2499.00, 40.00, 3.00, '7113', 5, 0, 'Celestial Star Adjustable Ring in Silver | Pearlica', 'Shop celestial spark star adjustable ring in 925 sterling silver with CZ stones. Elegant, modern jewellery perfect for daily wear and styling.', 'star ring, celestial ring, adjustable ring, sterling silver ring, CZ ring, minimal jewellery, elegant ring, modern jewellery, daily wear ring, stylish jewellery, Pearlica jewellery', 'Inspired by the brilliance of the night sky, this 925 sterling silver adjustable ring features a delicate starburst charm suspended between sleek criss-cross bands. One band is adorned with shimmering micro CZ stones, while the other maintains a smooth polished finish — creating a beautiful contrast of sparkle and minimalism.\r\nLightweight yet eye-catching, this celestial-inspired ring is perfect for everyday shine with a dreamy touch.', '•	Metal: 925 Sterling Silver\r\n•	Plating: Premium Rhodium Finish\r\n•	Stone Type: High-Quality Cubic Zirconia\r\n•	Design: Starburst with Criss-Cross Band\r\n•	Setting: Micro Pave Stone Setting\r\n•	Finish: High Polish with Sparkle Detail\r\n•	Size: Free Size (Adjustable)', '•	92.5% Pure Sterling Silver\r\n•	Anti-Tarnish Rhodium Coating\r\n•	Precision Stone Setting\r\n•	Skin-Friendly & Hypoallergenic\r\n•	Long-Lasting Shine\r\n•	Lightweight & Comfortable Fit', '•	Perfect for daily wear and office styling\r\n•	Stack with thin silver bands for a trendy look\r\n•	Pair with star or moon-themed jewellery\r\n•	Ideal gifting option for birthdays or special occasions', 'active', '2026-03-20 07:25:39', '2026-07-28 09:25:08', NULL),
(141, 5, NULL, 'Classic Solitaire Elegance Adjustable Ring – 925 Sterling Silver', 'classic-solitaire-elegance-adjustable-ring-925-sterling-silver', 'RNSL028', 'Silver', '925', 2.350, 'Free Size (Adjustable)', 0.00, 3332.00, 40.00, 3.00, '7113', 3, 0, 'Classic Solitaire Adjustable Ring | Pearlica', 'Shop classic solitaire elegance adjustable ring in 925 sterling silver with CZ stone. Timeless, elegant jewellery perfect for daily wear and occasions.', 'solitaire ring, adjustable ring, sterling silver ring, CZ ring, engagement ring, classic jewellery, elegant ring, timeless jewellery, daily wear ring, gift jewellery, Pearlica jewellery', 'Timeless, graceful, and forever elegant — this 925 sterling silver adjustable ring features a brilliant round-cut solitaire stone set in a secure four-prong setting. The split shank band adds a modern touch while enhancing the sparkle of the center stone.\r\nDesigned to capture light beautifully, this ring is perfect for engagements, special occasions, or anyone who loves classic sophistication.', '•	Metal: 925 Sterling Silver\r\n•	Plating: Premium Rhodium Finish\r\n•	Stone Type: High-Grade Cubic Zirconia\r\n•	Stone Cut: Round Brilliant Cut\r\n•	Setting Style: Four-Prong Solitaire Setting\r\n•	Band Style: Split Shank Design\r\n•	Size: Free Size (Adjustable)', '•	92.5% Pure Sterling Silver\r\n•	Anti-Tarnish Rhodium Protection\r\n•	Precision Stone Setting\r\n•	Skin-Friendly & Hypoallergenic\r\n•	Long-Lasting High Polish Shine\r\n•	Lightweight & Comfortable for Daily Wear', '•	Perfect as an engagement-style ring\r\n•	Pair with a slim silver bracelet for a refined look\r\n•	Ideal for formal events and evening wear\r\n•	Can be stacked with a minimal band for a layered style', 'active', '2026-03-20 07:28:56', '2026-07-28 09:20:55', NULL),
