(161, 22, NULL, 'Double Heart Charm Bracelet – 925 Sterling Silver', 'double-heart-charm-bracelet-925-sterling-silver', 'BLSL015', 'Silver', '925', 3.000, '17 cm + 3 cm Adjustable', 0.00, 3165.00, 40.00, 3.00, '7113', 3, 0, 'Double Heart Charm Bracelet in Silver | Pearlica', 'Shop double heart charm bracelet in 925 sterling silver with CZ stones. Romantic, elegant jewellery perfect for daily wear and occasions.', 'double heart bracelet, heart charm bracelet, sterling silver bracelet, CZ bracelet, romantic jewellery, elegant bracelet, silver bracelet, daily wear bracelet, gift jewellery, stylish jewellery, Pearlica jewellery', 'Celebrate elegance and romance with this beautifully crafted double heart bracelet in 925 sterling silver. Featuring a layered heart motif with delicate cubic zirconia detailing and a dangling solitaire charm, this bracelet blends minimal sophistication with a romantic touch. The sleek chain design ensures a lightweight feel while maintaining a refined, luxurious look perfect for daily wear or special occasions.', '•	Metal: 925 Sterling Silver\r\n•	Stone Type: AAA Grade Cubic Zirconia\r\n•	Design: Double Heart Charm Bracelet\r\n•	Finishing: High Polish Silver\r\n•	Closure: Spring Ring Clasp\r\n•	Size: 17 cm + 3 cm Adjustable Extension', '•	92.5% Pure Sterling Silver\r\n•	Precision Stone Setting Craftsmanship\r\n•	AAA Grade Cubic Zirconia Stones\r\n•	High-Durability Rhodium Plating\r\n•	Anti-Tarnish Protective Coating\r\n•	Mirror Gloss Premium Finish\r\n•	Lightweight & Comfortable for Daily Wear', '•	Perfect for romantic or minimal everyday jewellery styling\r\n•	Pair with heart-shaped pendants or stud earrings for a coordinated look\r\n•	Stack with delicate chain bracelets for a layered wrist style\r\n•	Ideal gift choice for anniversaries, birthdays, or special moments ', 'active', '2026-03-20 09:11:11', '2026-07-27 19:51:01', NULL);
